### 📄 Get all vendors
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors
Accept: application/json

###

### 📄 Get active vendors only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors?isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Search vendor by name
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors?search=CRATING
Accept: application/json

###

### 🔍 Get vendor by id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors/1
Accept: application/json

###

### ❌ Invalid id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/vendors/abc
Accept: application/json
